# Auto-generated data files — live ONLY on the orphan `ventu-data` branch
# (1-commit history via commit --amend + force-with-lease; see
# docs/DATA-BRANCH-MIGRATION.md). Local clones hydrate with
# `npm run data:bootstrap`. Nothing here is ever committed to main.
public/data/
data-state/
data-state/**

